    "title": "Hollywood Crush: Match3 puzzle",
    "description": "Experience the road to Hollywood.\r\nIn Hollywood Crush, match 3 to dress up and live out your red-carpet dream!\r\n\r\nAs a young, rising star playing small roles and working as an extra, your journey in Hollywood has been challenging. But life is like a box of chocolates, you never know what you're going to get. Along with the news of the famous star Peter's passing, there is also the revelation of an undisclosed daughter, who happens to be you. \r\n\r\nFrom this moment on, your life takes a whirlwind of transformation. Alongside navigating the ever-watchful eyes of the media, you must also be on guard against the obstacles posed by your half-sister Rose, who you share a father with\r\n\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Easy to play, match 3 to beat addictive levels.\r\n\u25a0 customize outfits for any occasion\r\n\u25a0 1,000s of outfits to choose from, including exclusive high-end dresses to stand out from the crowd.\r\n\u25a0 Build your own dazzling studio.\r\n\u25a0 Simulate the drama of being a star and face all challenges.\r\n\u25a0 Romantic Hollywood encounters: choose a handsome partner.\r\n\r\nAre you ready to start your Hollywood journey?\r\n\r\n\u25bcFacebook\u25bc\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/en.HollywoodCrush\r\n\r\n\u25bcCustomer Support Email\u25bc\r\nsupport.hollywood@matchrella.com",
